# graphify scope control — keep the knowledge graph to real first-party source
# + curated project docs. Wins over .gitignore (last-match-wins). See `/graphify`.
#
# Philosophy (per Glen): exclude third-party, build output, and machine-generated
# junk — but KEEP hand-written architecture/research/audit/spec/history docs,
# including those under .omo/ and .sisyphus/ (audits, plans, reports, handovers).
# Only the machine-generated DUMPS inside those dirs are stripped, not the prose.

# ── Third-party / vendored ──
webview/vendor/
deps/
node_modules/

# ── Build trees + fetched deps ──
build*/
**/_deps/
installer/output/

# ── Python virtualenvs & bytecode (the .omo/.sisyphus bulk = qa-venv) ──
**/qa-venv/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyi
*.so
*.typed
*.dist-info/

# ── Machine-generated session / state / run dumps (NOT docs) ──
.omc/sessions/        # 1319 session JSONs
.omc/state/
.omc/logs/
webview/.omc/
**/run-continuation/
**/boulder.json
.remember/
.opencode/
.wwebjs_auth/
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/skills/

# ── evidence/ & qa/ : pure machine-generated dumps (console logs, ax-tree
#    captures, test-runner output, screenshots). Dropped wholesale per Glen.
#    Architecture/history lives in audit/ plans/ reports/ handover/ (KEPT below).
.omo/evidence/
.omo/qa/
.sisyphus/evidence/
.sisyphus/qa/

# ── graphify's own output ──
graphify-out/

# ── Binary / media artifacts (no value as nodes; avoid vision/Whisper cost) ──
*.db
*.exe
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
*.avi
LICENSES/

# KEPT on purpose: .omo|.sisyphus/{audit,plans,reports,handover,notepads,drafts,
# handoffs}, root HANDOVER*.md, coordination.md, RESTART-PROMPT.md, .omc/{specs,plans},
# docs/**, all src/** + webview/src/**, package.json/tsconfig (deps).
